## Heavenly treasures

treasure-bloom = A fragrance of pure qi brushes your senses. A heavenly treasure is blooming {$where}! The first to pluck it claims it.
treasure-digging = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} kneels and begins to carefully dig up {THE($target)}.
treasure-plucked = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} plucks the glowing spirit herb!
treasure-claimed = The fragrance of the heavenly treasure fades. Someone has claimed it.
treasure-eaten-cultivator = Heavenly qi floods your foundation! (+{$insight} insight, qi refilled)
treasure-eaten-body = Heavenly qi sinks into your bones as tempering!
treasure-eaten-mortal = It tastes like morning dew and lightning. You feel wonderful.

## The ancestral ring

ancestral-ring-awake = Something old and smug lives in the stone.
ancestral-ring-dormant = A dormant soul sleeps in the stone. Use the ring in hand to try to wake it.
ancestral-ring-mortal = It's a ring. You turn it over in your hand. Nothing happens.
ancestral-ring-channel = You channel a thread of qi into the stone... something stirs.
ancestral-ring-stirring = The soul in the stone is still stirring. Give it time.
ancestral-ring-already-awake = The master in the stone is already awake, and already disappointed in you.
ancestral-ring-yawn = An old voice yawns inside your head. "Ten thousand years... and THIS is my successor?"
ancestral-ring-welcome = You are an ancient master, your soul sealed in this ring for ten thousand years. Guide your bearer on their path (or berate them). Only they can hear you.
ancestral-ring-role-name = Ancient Master
ancestral-ring-role-description = An ancient master living in an ancestral ring. Only the ring's bearer can hear you. Guide them, scold them, lend them your qi.
ancestral-ring-role-rules = You are a mentor, not an antagonist, unless your bearer is one. Help or hinder them as a wise and grumpy old master would.
ancestral-ring-speak-title = Speak to your bearer
ancestral-ring-speak-prompt = What do you say?
ancestral-ring-said = You murmur to your bearer: "{$message}"
ancestral-ring-heard = An old voice echoes in your head: "{$message}"
ancestral-ring-no-dantian = Your bearer has no dantian to receive your qi.
ancestral-ring-lent-qi = Warm, ancient qi flows into you from the ring.
ancestral-ring-banished = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} presses {THE($item)} against {THE($target)}. A faint wail echoes from the stone.
